Data attribution
================

This project reads the GTFS feed "Telangana opendata GTFS TGSRTC" published by
Open Data Telangana (https://data.telangana.gov.in/) for the Telangana State
Road Transport Corporation (TGSRTC).

The feed is NOT included in this repository. Its licence terms have not yet
been confirmed by the maintainer; the exact attribution statement required by
the publisher will be added here before any derived data is distributed.

Base map data: OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
